{
 "title": "Bus Driver",
 "children": [
  {
   "title": "Overview",
   "lines": [
    "Drum-bus glue, modelled",
    "from measurement of",
    "Ableton's Drum Buss.",
    "",
    "It is NOT transparent",
    "at its defaults: it",
    "adds about 3 dB and",
    "saturates. Only Dry/Wet",
    "at 0 is a true bypass.",
    "That is what the",
    "original does."
   ]
  },
  {
   "title": "Controls",
   "children": [
    {
     "title": "Drive + Character",
     "lines": [
      "Three characters,",
      "measured to be quite",
      "different machines:",
      "",
      "Soft is a WAVEFOLDER.",
      "Past about half way its",
      "3rd harmonic overtakes",
      "the fundamental and the",
      "tone hollows out.",
      "",
      "Medium is a limiter and",
      "the only one with any",
      "asymmetry.",
      "",
      "Hard is a clean clipper",
      "and reaches its ceiling",
      "fastest."
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Crunch",
     "lines": [
      "Mid-high grit.",
      "",
      "Its brightness is not",
      "an EQ curve: the linear",
      "response is a broad mid",
      "boost, and the high end",
      "comes from harmonics it",
      "generates.",
      "",
      "Damp is the antidote."
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Damp",
     "lines": [
      "A one-pole low-pass,",
      "500 Hz to 20 kHz.",
      "",
      "The number IS the -3 dB",
      "corner, and the low end",
      "is untouched at every",
      "setting.",
      "",
      "It sits after Crunch,",
      "so it tames what Crunch",
      "adds."
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Transients",
     "lines": [
      "Bipolar, centre off,",
      "and asymmetric by sign.",
      "",
      "DOWN is a gate: it",
      "shortens the tail and",
      "leaves the hit alone.",
      "",
      "UP raises both the",
      "attack and the sustain,",
      "attack more.",
      "",
      "Most of the range is in",
      "the last quarter."
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Compress",
     "lines": [
      "A switch, not an",
      "amount - the compressor",
      "is fixed.",
      "",
      "Threshold -20 dBFS,",
      "about 2.3:1 with a soft",
      "knee, 11 dB of makeup,",
      "fast attack and a long",
      "release near 420 ms.",
      "",
      "It sits BEFORE the",
      "drive, so it changes",
      "what the distortion",
      "sees."
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Boom",
     "lines": [
      "A tuned sub generator,",
      "30 to 90 Hz.",
      "",
      "It boosts around the",
      "tuning and CUTS below",
      "it, which is what stops",
      "it adding subsonic mud.",
      "",
      "Amount does very little",
      "past 0.75.",
      "",
      "Decay sets the ring",
      "time, not the level."
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Trim and Output",
     "lines": [
      "Trim is before the",
      "distortion, so it sets",
      "how hard you hit it.",
      "",
      "Output is after, so it",
      "is a clean level",
      "control.",
      "",
      "Both are exact gains."
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Dry/Wet",
     "lines": [
      "A blend across the",
      "whole device, so under",
      "100% is parallel",
      "processing.",
      "",
      "At 0 it is a true",
      "bypass and nulls."
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "title": "Signal order",
   "lines": [
    "Trim, Transients,",
    "Compress, Drive,",
    "Crunch, Damp, Boom,",
    "Dry/Wet, Output.",
    "",
    "This order was measured",
    "from the device, not",
    "taken from its docs."
   ]
  },
  {
   "title": "Fidelity",
   "lines": [
    "Validated against the",
    "22 stock Drum Buss",
    "presets on audio never",
    "used to build it.",
    "",
    "Level within about",
    "1 dB; spectral match",
    "around 5-6 dB in third",
    "octaves.",
    "",
    "Close, not exact. It is",
    "a model, not a clone."
   ]
  },
  {
   "title": "MIDI",
   "lines": [
    "None. Audio only."
   ]
  }
 ]
}